Small spoiler follows:










































I had a cursed cloak I wanted to get rid of.  So I dipped it in one of the
fountains on the mall level.  
A guard saw me, and shouted that I should leave the fountain alone.
So I went to the next fountain.  No guards around, so I started dipping.
After a while, a guard showed up and told me to stop.  I ignored him,
they hadn't done anything nasty last time.  Suddenly the fountain overflowed,
and the guard drowned.
The other guards didn't care much about that, but continued to tell me to stop.
After a while, their patience was used up.  I heard a guard's whistle,
and found myself under attack. Fortunately, I had a +6 long sword and a
+3 ring of increase damage, so I got to the staircase alive.

It seems that the dev team has done a really good job with 3.1. :-)
